          </div>

          {/* ── The details sheet ──────────────────────────────────────────
              Presented over the conversation, iOS-26 style: the card scales
              back behind a dim, and the sheet arrives from the bottom on a
              glass ground. It stops 44pt short of the top so the thing it
              came from stays visible - that is what makes it read as pushed
              over the chat rather than as a different screen. */}
          <label class="sdim" for="ph-det"></label>

          <div class="sheet">
            <span class="sgrab"></span>
            <div class="shead">
              <label class="sdone glass" for="ph-det">Done</label>
            </div>

